  "help bundle": "Create, verify, or list git bundle files\n\nUsage: grit help bundle [COMMAND]\n\nCommands:\n  create    Write a bundle file from revision specs\n  verify    Check that a bundle file is well-formed\n  list      List refs recorded in a bundle header\n  unbundle  Ingest a bundle pack into the current repository\n  help      Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)\n",
  "help bundle create": "Write a bundle file from revision specs\n\nUsage: grit help bundle create\n",
  "help bundle help": "Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)\n\nUsage: grit help bundle help [COMMAND]\n\nCommands:\n  create    Write a bundle file from revision specs\n  verify    Check that a bundle file is well-formed\n  list      List refs recorded in a bundle header\n  unbundle  Ingest a bundle pack into the current repository\n  help      Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)\n",
  "help bundle help create": "Write a bundle file from revision specs\n\nUsage: grit help bundle help create\n",
