  "help history": "Rewrite commits without a sequencer (plan, then apply refs atomically)\n\nUsage: grit help history [COMMAND]\n\nCommands:\n  drop    Remove a commit and replay descendants onto its parent\n  move    Reorder a commit on the first-parent chain of `HEAD`\n  reword  Replace a commit message and replay descendants onto the new history\n  fixup   Apply staged changes onto a commit and replay descendants\n  absorb  Assign staged hunks into recent commits and replay descendants once\n  rebase  Replay local commits onto a new base (same as top-level `grit rebase`)\n  split   Peel path-limited changes out of a commit into a new parent and replay descendants\n  undo    Undo the last applied history rewrite using the recorded ref plan\n  squash  Fold a revision range into the oldest commit and replay descendants\n  help    Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)\n",
  "help history absorb": "Assign staged hunks into recent commits and replay descendants once\n\nUsage: grit help history absorb\n",
  "help history drop": "Remove a commit and replay descendants onto its parent\n\nUsage: grit help history drop\n",
  "help history fixup": "Apply staged changes onto a commit and replay descendants\n\nUsage: grit help history fixup\n",
  "help history help": "Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)\n\nUsage: grit help history help [COMMAND]\n\nCommands:\n  drop    Remove a commit and replay descendants onto its parent\n  move    Reorder a commit on the first-parent chain of `HEAD`\n  reword  Replace a commit message and replay descendants onto the new history\n  fixup   Apply staged changes onto a commit and replay descendants\n  absorb  Assign staged hunks into recent commits and replay descendants once\n  rebase  Replay local commits onto a new base (same as top-level `grit rebase`)\n  split   Peel path-limited changes out of a commit into a new parent and replay descendants\n  undo    Undo the last applied history rewrite using the recorded ref plan\n  squash  Fold a revision range into the oldest commit and replay descendants\n  help    Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)\n",
  "help history help absorb": "Assign staged hunks into recent commits and replay descendants once\n\nUsage: grit help history help absorb\n",
