  "help hooks": "List hook scripts or run one by name\n\nUsage: grit help hooks [COMMAND]\n\nCommands:\n  list  List hook scripts in the resolved hooks directory\n  run   Run a hook by name (passes `--` arguments through to the script)\n  help  Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)\n",
  "help hooks help": "Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)\n\nUsage: grit help hooks help [COMMAND]\n\nCommands:\n  list  List hook scripts in the resolved hooks directory\n  run   Run a hook by name (passes `--` arguments through to the script)\n  help  Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)\n",
  "help hooks help help": "Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)\n\nUsage: grit help hooks help help\n",
