  "help notes": "List, show, add, or remove Git notes on commits\n\nUsage: grit help notes [COMMAND]\n\nCommands:\n  list    List notes attached to commits\n  show    Show the note for a revision\n  add     Add or replace a note on a revision\n  remove  Remove notes from one or more revisions\n  help    Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)\n",
  "help notes add": "Add or replace a note on a revision\n\nUsage: grit help notes add\n",
  "help notes help": "Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)\n\nUsage: grit help notes help [COMMAND]\n\nCommands:\n  list    List notes attached to commits\n  show    Show the note for a revision\n  add     Add or replace a note on a revision\n  remove  Remove notes from one or more revisions\n  help    Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)\n",
  "help notes help add": "Add or replace a note on a revision\n\nUsage: grit help notes help add\n",
