  "help receive-pack": "Accept a push over stdin/stdout (run by ssh and grit-http-server)\n\nUsage: grit help receive-pack\n",
  "help reflog": "Show, delete, or expire reflog entries\n\nUsage: grit help reflog [COMMAND]\n\nCommands:\n  delete  Remove one or more reflog entries (`ref@\n          `)\n  expire  Drop reflog entries older than configured or explicit cutoffs\n  list    List refs that currently have a reflog\n  help    Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)\n",
  "help reflog delete": "Remove one or more reflog entries (`ref@\n`)\n\nUsage: grit help reflog delete\n",
  "help reflog expire": "Drop reflog entries older than configured or explicit cutoffs\n\nUsage: grit help reflog expire\n",
  "help reflog help": "Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)\n\nUsage: grit help reflog help [COMMAND]\n\nCommands:\n  delete  Remove one or more reflog entries (`ref@\n          `)\n  expire  Drop reflog entries older than configured or explicit cutoffs\n  list    List refs that currently have a reflog\n  help    Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)\n",
  "help reflog help delete": "Remove one or more reflog entries (`ref@\n`)\n\nUsage: grit help reflog help delete\n",
  "help reflog help expire": "Drop reflog entries older than configured or explicit cutoffs\n\nUsage: grit help reflog help expire\n",
  "help reflog help help": "Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)\n\nUsage: grit help reflog help help\n",
  "help reflog help list": "List refs that currently have a reflog\n\nUsage: grit help reflog help list\n",
  "help reflog list": "List refs that currently have a reflog\n\nUsage: grit help reflog list\n",
  "help remote": "List remotes, or add one\n\nUsage: grit help remote [COMMAND]\n\nCommands:\n  add       Add a new remote\n  set-url   Set the fetch or push URL for an existing remote\n  remove    Remove a remote and its remote-tracking refs\n  prune     Delete stale remote-tracking refs without fetching\n  set-head  Set or delete `refs/remotes/<name>/HEAD`\n  show      Summarize a remote (URLs, branches, pull config)\n  rename    Rename an existing remote\n  refs      List references on a remote (like `git ls-remote`)\n  help      Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)\n",
  "help remote add": "Add a new remote\n\nUsage: grit help remote add\n",
  "help remote help": "Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)\n\nUsage: grit help remote help [COMMAND]\n\nCommands:\n  add       Add a new remote\n  set-url   Set the fetch or push URL for an existing remote\n  remove    Remove a remote and its remote-tracking refs\n  prune     Delete stale remote-tracking refs without fetching\n  set-head  Set or delete `refs/remotes/<name>/HEAD`\n  show      Summarize a remote (URLs, branches, pull config)\n  rename    Rename an existing remote\n  refs      List references on a remote (like `git ls-remote`)\n  help      Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)\n",
  "help remote help add": "Add a new remote\n\nUsage: grit help remote help add\n",
