  "help share help leave": "Leave a shared branch; your head stays a branch in your space\n\nUsage: grit help share help leave\n",
  "help share help list": "List your shared branches, and where each member's head is\n\nUsage: grit help share help list\n",
  "help share help remove": "Remove people from a shared branch, or end its share when you name nobody\n\nUsage: grit help share help remove\n",
  "help share help resolve": "Put your head and another member's back together after they diverged\n\nUsage: grit help share help resolve\n",
  "help share help revoke": "Revoke a share link\n\nUsage: grit help share help revoke\n",
  "help share leave": "Leave a shared branch; your head stays a branch in your space\n\nUsage: grit help share leave\n",
  "help share list": "List your shared branches, and where each member's head is\n\nUsage: grit help share list\n",
  "help share remove": "Remove people from a shared branch, or end its share when you name nobody\n\nUsage: grit help share remove\n",
  "help share resolve": "Put your head and another member's back together after they diverged\n\nUsage: grit help share resolve\n",
  "help share revoke": "Revoke a share link\n\nUsage: grit help share revoke\n",
  "help shortlog": "List the commits on this branch that aren't on the target branch yet\n\nUsage: grit help shortlog\n",
  "help show": "Show information about a commit, tag, or branch (defaults to HEAD)\n\nUsage: grit help show\n",
  "help skill": "Print an agent skill (SKILL.md) that explains how to use grit\n\nUsage: grit help skill\n",
  "help slice": "Named sets of paths to check out together, kept on the server's target branch\n\nUsage: grit help slice [COMMAND]\n\nCommands:\n  list    List the slices\n  new     Make a slice\n  edit    Add paths to a slice or remove them\n  delete  Delete a slice\n  help    Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)\n",
  "help slice delete": "Delete a slice\n\nUsage: grit help slice delete\n",
  "help slice edit": "Add paths to a slice or remove them\n\nUsage: grit help slice edit\n",
  "help slice help": "Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)\n\nUsage: grit help slice help [COMMAND]\n\nCommands:\n  list    List the slices\n  new     Make a slice\n  edit    Add paths to a slice or remove them\n  delete  Delete a slice\n  help    Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)\n",
  "help slice help delete": "Delete a slice\n\nUsage: grit help slice help delete\n",
  "help slice help edit": "Add paths to a slice or remove them\n\nUsage: grit help slice help edit\n",
  "help slice help help": "Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)\n\nUsage: grit help slice help help\n",
  "help slice help list": "List the slices\n\nUsage: grit help slice help list\n",
  "help slice help new": "Make a slice\n\nUsage: grit help slice help new\n",
  "help slice list": "List the slices\n\nUsage: grit help slice list\n",
  "help slice new": "Make a slice\n\nUsage: grit help slice new\n",
  "help stash": "Save or restore shelved work\n\nUsage: grit help stash [COMMAND]\n\nCommands:\n  push    Save local changes to the stash and reset the working tree\n  list    List stash entries\n  show    Show the summary or patch for a stash entry\n  branch  Create a branch at the stash base commit and apply the stash with `--index`\n  clear   Remove every stash entry\n  apply   Apply a stash entry without removing it\n  pop     Apply a stash entry and remove it when there are no conflicts\n  drop    Remove a stash entry without applying it\n  help    Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)\n",
  "help stash apply": "Apply a stash entry without removing it\n\nUsage: grit help stash apply\n",
  "help stash branch": "Create a branch at the stash base commit and apply the stash with `--index`\n\nUsage: grit help stash branch\n",
  "help stash clear": "Remove every stash entry\n\nUsage: grit help stash clear\n",
  "help stash drop": "Remove a stash entry without applying it\n\nUsage: grit help stash drop\n",
  "help stash help": "Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)\n\nUsage: grit help stash help [COMMAND]\n\nCommands:\n  push    Save local changes to the stash and reset the working tree\n  list    List stash entries\n  show    Show the summary or patch for a stash entry\n  branch  Create a branch at the stash base commit and apply the stash with `--index`\n  clear   Remove every stash entry\n  apply   Apply a stash entry without removing it\n  pop     Apply a stash entry and remove it when there are no conflicts\n  drop    Remove a stash entry without applying it\n  help    Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)\n",
  "help stash help apply": "Apply a stash entry without removing it\n\nUsage: grit help stash help apply\n",
